<title>UK: BAA Plc prices 200 mln stg 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>BAA Plc prices 200 mln stg 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by joint lead managers HSBC Markets (books) and BZW, has now been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAA PLC</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   COUPON     7.875     MATURITY    10.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.315    PAY DATE    10.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  35 BP     REOFFER    99.315    SPREAD	+46 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.50 PCT GILT DUE 2006</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A SPENS CALL OPTION AND A PUT OPTION</p>
<p>		SUBJECT TO RESTRUCTURING EVENT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
